msgid "可选 VGA 文本控制台"
msgstr "Optional VGA Text Console"

msgid "启用与退出"
msgstr "Enabling and Disabling"

msgid ""
"默认继续使用原有 framebuffer TTY。只有内核命令行包含完整的 ``console=vga`` 选项时，才尝试启用独立 VGA Text "
"Mode 后端。 在 GRUB 菜单按 ``e``，将该参数追加到 ``multiboot2`` 行，再启动即可临时验证。 "
"长期配置应修改所用启动项的内核参数，并保留系统更新前的配置备份。 移除该参数，或在它之后添加 "
"``console=framebuffer``，恢复默认选择。"
msgstr ""
"The existing framebuffer TTY remains the default. The separate VGA Text Mode"
" backend is attempted only when the kernel command line contains the "
"complete ``console=vga`` option. For a temporary test, press ``e`` in the "
"GRUB menu, append it to the ``multiboot2`` line, and boot. For permanent "
"configuration, edit the kernel arguments of the boot entry in use and retain"
" a configuration backup from before system updates. Remove the option, or "
"append ``console=framebuffer`` after it, to restore the default selection."

msgid ""
"保留现有 ``gfxpayload=keep`` 和图形设备初始化：内核会把文字控制台切换为 VGA 模式，但仍保留图形设备信息供 Xorg "
"接管。不要用 ``gfxpayload=text`` 代替此参数；没有可用图形后端时不能凭空启动 Xorg。"
msgstr ""
"Keep the existing ``gfxpayload=keep`` and graphics device initialization. "
"The kernel switches the text console to VGA mode while retaining graphics "
"device information for Xorg to take over. Do not substitute "
"``gfxpayload=text`` for this option; Xorg cannot start without an available "
"graphics backend."

msgid "设备要求"
msgstr "Device Requirements"

msgid ""
"该后端使用传统 VGA 端口和显存字符平面，固定为 80 列、25 行、8×16 字体 （通常扫描输出为 720×400）。已实现 Bochs/QEMU"
" Standard VGA 和 VMware SVGA II 的图形模式恢复接口；是否使用 UEFI 不是唯一判断条件，设备必须实际 提供兼容 VGA "
"解码。纯 GOP、无 VGA 兼容平面或无法安全恢复图形模式的设备会 输出警告并保留原控制台后端。没有 framebuffer 的 Legacy VGA"
" 设备可用于 纯文字控制台，但无法切换到 Xorg。"
msgstr ""
"This backend uses legacy VGA ports and the video-memory character plane, "
"fixed at 80 columns, 25 rows, and an 8×16 font (typically a 720×400 "
"scanout). Graphics-mode restoration is implemented for Bochs/QEMU Standard "
"VGA and VMware SVGA II. UEFI use alone does not determine eligibility; the "
"device must actually provide compatible VGA decoding. Pure GOP devices, "
"devices without a VGA-compatible plane, or devices whose graphics mode "
"cannot safely be restored produce a warning and retain the original console "
"backend. Legacy VGA devices without a framebuffer can provide a text-only "
"console but cannot switch to Xorg."

msgid "终端与图形会话"
msgstr "Terminals and Graphical Sessions"

msgid ""
"此模式只替换文字终端后端。登录仍使用原有 getty、``/bin/login`` 和用户配置的 Shell；默认 Bash "
"继续读取系统和用户的启动配置，并在交互式终端自动运行 fastfetch，随后显示普通命令提示符。没有专用的 VGA 登录程序或测试面板。"
msgstr ""
"This mode replaces only the text-terminal backend. Login still uses the "
"existing getty, ``/bin/login``, and the user's configured shell. Default "
"Bash continues to read system and user startup configuration, runs fastfetch"
" automatically in interactive terminals, and then shows the normal command "
"prompt. There is no dedicated VGA login program or test panel."

msgid ""
"``tty1`` 至 ``tty6`` 各自保留主屏、备用屏、光标、属性、滚动区域及分片解析状态， 窗口大小报告为 "
"80×25。登录、termios、进程组、信号、权限与原 VT 子系统共用。 支持原有 VT 快捷键和 Linux VT_PROCESS 交接；Xorg"
" 请求图形模式时恢复图形 设备，切回文字 VT 时恢复对应字符屏幕。GUI 运行期间后台终端输出不写 VGA 显存。 有未释放的 GPU "
"模式租约、无法完成设备切换时返回错误，不强行拆除 GPU 资源。"
msgstr ""
"``tty1`` through ``tty6`` each retain their main and alternate screens, "
"cursor, attributes, scrolling region, and incremental parsing state, "
"reporting an 80×25 window. Login, termios, process groups, signals, and "
"permissions share the existing VT subsystem. Existing VT shortcuts and Linux"
" VT_PROCESS handover are supported. Graphics devices are restored when Xorg "
"requests graphics mode; switching back to a text VT restores its character "
"screen. Background terminal output does not write VGA video memory while the"
" GUI runs. Outstanding GPU mode leases or an inability to complete device "
"switching return errors rather than forcibly dismantling GPU resources."

msgid ""
"支持常用 ANSI/VT 操作：16 色前景和背景、反显和隐藏、光标移动与保存恢复、 "
"清屏清行、字符及行的插入删除、滚动区域与正反向滚动、延迟自动换行、制表位、 备用屏幕、硬件光标显示、设备属性及光标位置查询。256 色和 RGB "
"请求映射到 最接近的 16 色；UTF-8 按完整字符解析，字库内的拉丁字符和线框符号可显示。 "
"提供应用光标模式、方向键、Home/End、Insert/Delete、PageUp/PageDown、 F1–F12 以及它们的常用修饰组合。"
msgstr ""
"Common ANSI/VT operations are supported: 16-color foregrounds and "
"backgrounds, reverse and conceal, cursor movement/save/restore, screen/line "
"erasure, character/line insertion and deletion, scrolling regions and "
"forward/reverse scrolling, delayed auto-wrap, tab stops, alternate screens, "
"hardware cursor visibility, device attributes, and cursor-position queries. "
"256-color and RGB requests map to the nearest of 16 colors. UTF-8 is parsed "
"as complete characters, and Latin characters and box-drawing symbols in the "
"font can be displayed. Application cursor mode, arrow keys, Home/End, "
"Insert/Delete, PageUp/PageDown, F1–F12, and their common modifier "
"combinations are provided."

msgid "未提供的表现形式"
msgstr "Unsupported Presentation Features"

msgid "不绘制 framebuffer 启动画面、位图 logo、图片或任意像素图形。"
msgstr ""
"No framebuffer boot screen, bitmap logo, images, or arbitrary pixel graphics"
" are drawn."

msgid "不模拟粗体、细体、斜体、下划线、删除线、字符闪烁及多种字号；相应 SGR 安全忽略。16 种背景色使用属性最高位，因此不启用硬件字符闪烁。"
msgstr ""
"Bold, faint, italic, underline, strikethrough, blinking text, and multiple "
"font sizes are not emulated; corresponding SGR codes are safely ignored. The"
" 16 background colors use the top attribute bit, so hardware text blinking "
"is not enabled."

msgid ""
"不提供完整中文、全宽 Unicode、组合字形和 emoji 字库；固定字库之外的 字符显示 ``?``。这不会阻止 GUI "
"会话继续使用原有字体和中文支持。"
msgstr ""
"No complete Chinese, full-width Unicode, combining-glyph, or emoji font is "
"provided; characters outside the fixed font display as ``?``. GUI sessions "
"can still use their existing fonts and Chinese support."

msgid ""
"不提供真正的 256 色/RGB 色深、可变文本行列数、像素鼠标光标、终端内图片、 窗口标题、剪贴板或超链接。OSC/DCS "
"等不支持的字符串被完整消费，不泄露到屏幕。"
msgstr ""
"True 256-color/RGB depth, variable text dimensions, pixel mouse cursors, "
"terminal images, window titles, clipboard, and hyperlinks are not provided. "
"Unsupported strings such as OSC/DCS are consumed in full and do not leak "
"onto the screen."

msgid "光标支持方块和底线形状；竖线光标退化为底线。粗体等字符样式与光标形状是 不同功能。"
msgstr ""
"The cursor supports block and underline shapes; a vertical-bar cursor falls "
"back to underline. Character styles such as bold and cursor shape are "
"separate features."

msgid ""
"VGA 模式只替代文字 TTY。XDM、IceWM 的显示仍是正常图形模式，不能在字符 "
"平面上渲染它们。验证应同时检查文字阶段和进入、退出图形会话的实际显示； QEMU 的结果不能代替 VMware 或真实硬件验收。"
msgstr ""
"VGA mode replaces only text TTYs. XDM and IceWM still display in normal "
"graphics mode and cannot be rendered on the character plane. Verification "
"must inspect actual display both during the text phase and when entering and"
" leaving graphical sessions. QEMU results cannot replace VMware or physical "
"hardware acceptance testing."
